+     * forces GPU writes that miss in LLCC to not allocate cache lines, routing writes directly to DRAM.
+     * Without this, GPU 2D/3D rendered pixels are retained in the System Cache (LLCC),
+     * which CPU dc civac does not invalidate, resulting in CPU reading stale memory (0xa5a5a5a5).
+     * Clear SYSTEM_CACHE_CNTL_1 and GBIF_SCACHE_CNTL0/1 as no LLCC slice is activated. */
+    if (maps_[1]) {
